h-academy-id "q-76203" :question/problem "If $\\,\\text{Re}(x)=[\\begin{aligned}a & b \\\\ c & d\\end{aligned}]\\,$ and $\\,\\text{Im}(x)=[\\begin{aligned}e & f \\\\ g & h\\end{aligned}]\\,$ are the real and imaginary parts of the matrix $A=[\\begin{aligned}-3\\text{i} & 5\\text{i} \\\\ -4 & 5\\end{aligned}]\\,$ then what is the value of $ah-cf?$" :question/worked-solution "For the given matrix $A,$ we have that\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A & =[\\begin{aligned}-3\\text{i} & 5\\text{i} \\\\ -4 & 5\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}0-3\\text{i} & 0+5\\text{i} \\\\ -4+0\\text{i} & 5+0\\text{i}\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & ={{[\\begin{aligned}0 & 0 \\\\ -4 & 5\\end{aligned}]}_{⏟}}_{\\text{Re}(A)}+\\text{i}{{[\\begin{aligned}-3 & 5 \\\\ 0 & 0\\end{aligned}]}_{⏟}}_{\\text{Im}(A)}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo we have $a=0,c=-4,f=5$ and $h=0.$ Therefore,\n\n$$\nah-cf=0\\cdot 0-(-4)\\cdot 5=20.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-76203/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "3c28b8ae-71ef-5d26-895a-5d949fc5b164"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-76203"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id [:question/math-academy-id "q-38390"] :question/problem "If $\\,\\text{Re}(x)=[\\begin{aligned}a & b \\\\ c & d\\end{aligned}]\\,$ and $\\,\\text{Im}(x)=[\\begin{aligned}e & f \\\\ g & h\\end{aligned}]\\,$ are the real and imaginary parts of the matrix $A=[\\begin{aligned}3+5\\text{i} & -2-4\\text{i} \\\\ 2-3\\text{i} & 1-6\\text{i}\\end{aligned}]\\,$ then what is the value of $ad+eh?$" :question/worked-solution "For the given matrix $A,$ we have that\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A & =[\\begin{aligned}3+5\\text{i} & -2-4\\text{i} \\\\ 2-3\\text{i} & 1-6\\text{i}\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & ={{[\\begin{aligned}3 & -2 \\\\ 2 & 1\\end{aligned}]}_{⏟}}_{\\text{Re}(A)}+\\text{i}{{[\\begin{aligned}5 & -4 \\\\ -3 & -6\\end{aligned}]}_{⏟}}_{\\text{Im}(A)}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo we have $a=3,d=1,e=5$ and $h=-6.$ Therefore,\n\n$$\nad+eh=3\\cdot 1+5\\cdot (-6)=-27.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "q-76222/selection/cb9703075de07262eafc6d03fbc2d6f7a040eac4874a5a37ce4d8e338ac37da5" :answer/id #uuid "06d68b35-d8e9-58e1-92ba-7b22e799423e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}-4+2\\text{i} & 9-2\\text{i} \\\\ -4+2\\text{i} & 2+5\\text{i}\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-76222/selection/62185a639b9ddb0865031b9e22f363448430864a24dbdf3d364fa1e217fc6ae3" :answer/id #uuid "22db4077-0318-5e00-839d-2f3993ac2deb" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}5\\text{i}+2 & 9-2\\text{i} \\\\ -4+2\\text{i} & -4+2\\text{i}\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-76222/selection/76c9f5bb3735c40e4c2c2c74c8ff0af8c4ed2796f3a249fd9105b456279ec500" :answer/id #uuid "b2bb92ae-fdf0-5c1d-a431-e1158e1ea90d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}-4 & 9-2\\text{i} \\\\ -4+2\\text{i} & 7\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-76222/selection/990cb3d9a5cba64120acc7ad8136e5a8966ee6e1d1541eb8d131a28ae2dd58a1" :answer/id #uuid "6f3baffa-2d9b-5571-8746-4cf2a3e11482" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}-4 & -4+2\\text{i} \\\\ 9-2\\text{i} & 2+5\\text{i}\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-76222/selection/3ec7b0b46137a0813abf468a33374c8bab0234e2e2cefcaeb6fc22917056fef1" :answer/id #uuid "151fe5c4-7476-5e4f-94aa-e90e995a5eec" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}5\\text{i}+2 & -4+2\\text{i} \\\\ 9-2\\text{i} & -4+2\\text{i}\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-76222/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "18994d12-1a7c-5861-9a06-6ee6fdf9bbdf" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-76222/selection/cb9703075de07262eafc6d03fbc2d6f7a040eac4874a5a37ce4d8e338ac37da5" :answer-field/choices ["q-76222/selection/cb9703075de07262eafc6d03fbc2d6f7a040eac4874a5a37ce4d8e338ac37da5" "q-76222/selection/62185a639b9ddb0865031b9e22f363448430864a24dbdf3d364fa1e217fc6ae3" "q-76222/selection/76c9f5bb3735c40e4c2c2c74c8ff0af8c4ed2796f3a249fd9105b456279ec500" "q-76222/selection/990cb3d9a5cba64120acc7ad8136e5a8966ee6e1d1541eb8d131a28ae2dd58a1" "q-76222/selection/3ec7b0b46137a0813abf468a33374c8bab0234e2e2cefcaeb6fc22917056fef1"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-76222" :question/id #uuid "cd5e4893-04c2-58e1-988e-046f67812670" :question/math-academy-id "q-76222" :question/problem "If $\\,A=[\\begin{aligned}2-\\text{i} & 3+\\text{i} \\\\ 1+2\\text{i} & 1+\\text{i}\\end{aligned}]\\,$ and $\\,B=[\\begin{aligned}1+\\text{i} & 2+\\text{i} \\\\ -2+\\text{i} & 1-\\text{i}\\end{aligned}]\\,$, then $AB=$" :question/worked-solution "Multiplying the matrices using the usual method, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}AB & =[\\begin{aligned}2-\\text{i} & 3+\\text{i} \\\\ 1+2\\text{i} & 1+\\text{i}\\end{aligned}]\\cdot [\\begin{aligned}1+\\text{i} & 2+\\text{i} \\\\ -2+\\text{i} & 1-\\text{i}\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}(2-\\text{i})(1+\\text{i})+(3+\\text{i})(-2+\\text{i}) & (2-\\text{i})(2+\\text{i})+(3+\\text{i})(1-\\text{i}) \\\\ (1+2\\text{i})(1+\\text{i})+(1+\\text{i})(-2+\\text{i}) & (1+2\\text{i})(2+\\text{i})+(1+\\text{i})(1-\\text{i})\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}(3+\\text{i})+(-7+\\text{i}) & 5+(4-2\\text{i}) \\\\ (-1+3\\text{i})+(-3-\\text{i}) & 2+5\\text{i}\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}-4+2\\text{i} & 9-2\\text{i} \\\\ -4+2\\text{i} & 2+5\\text{i}\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["q-76222/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "83fad21d-6b36-5198-a13f-362d34342475"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-76222"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-76217/selection/8382bd14215591adf24dda522afde205928f725366615cbf4298d88730b08689" :answer/id #uuid "57aac1ee-8a18-5c66-8799-f46fbb5b37bb" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}14-3\\text{i} & 9-13\\text{i} \\\\ -5+9\\text{i} & 10+5\\text{i}\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-76217/selection/d307ece320c78d6227f57e4807b35d257a48492acd95c7cba0ecf44c4ceedfcb" :answer/id #uuid "2a3a43c5-32fc-58c7-8c5f-c4c651b3885d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}10+5\\text{i} & 9-13\\text{i} \\\\ -5+9\\text{i} & 14-3\\text{i}\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-76217/selection/0207f6ec6b2bf3f38f6c4715de29ea6762e93ec5c529826f275117145a223ecb" :answer/id #uuid "3519f4cc-7f5d-5081-824a-c5d6fe484ce5" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}-5+9\\text{i} & 9-13\\text{i} \\\\ 10+5\\text{i} & 14-3\\text{i}\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-76217/selection/1fd57827f288fabe1518ba7ece2c3b37ac7b6b5b9900bd718d79fc6cd204ae41" :answer/id #uuid "3b381c76-1673-5e7b-aa95-52869b55a3c5" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}-5+9\\text{i} & 14-3\\text{i} \\\\ 10+5\\text{i} & 9-13\\text{i}\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-76217/selection/1ec1d75e690a9ba57e9c386b7dce4e411fefccc7457bced1844c2211375e959b" :answer/id #uuid "90e07b7b-d05f-55ee-b2ec-363aa4234247" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}10+5\\text{i} & 14-3\\text{i} \\\\ -5+9\\text{i} & 9-13\\text{i}\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-76217/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "ca447862-cf40-598f-851c-412d8e940333" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-76217/selection/d307ece320c78d6227f57e4807b35d257a48492acd95c7cba0ecf44c4ceedfcb" :answer-field/choices ["q-76217/selection/8382bd14215591adf24dda522afde205928f725366615cbf4298d88730b08689" "q-76217/selection/d307ece320c78d6227f57e4807b35d257a48492acd95c7cba0ecf44c4ceedfcb" "q-76217/selection/0207f6ec6b2bf3f38f6c4715de29ea6762e93ec5c529826f275117145a223ecb" "q-76217/selection/1fd57827f288fabe1518ba7ece2c3b37ac7b6b5b9900bd718d79fc6cd204ae41" "q-76217/selection/1ec1d75e690a9ba57e9c386b7dce4e411fefccc7457bced1844c2211375e959b"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-76217" :question/id #uuid "eaa32e2e-c807-5da3-b10a-a7704147713e" :question/math-academy-id "q-76217" :question/problem "If $\\,A=[\\begin{aligned}2-3\\text{i} & \\text{i} \\\\ 3 & -1-\\text{i}\\end{aligned}]\\,$ and $\\,B=[\\begin{aligned}2\\text{i} & 5 \\\\ 1-4\\text{i} & 2+\\text{i}\\end{aligned}]\\,$, then $AB=$" :question/worked-solution "Multiplying the matrices using the usual method, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}AB & =[\\begin{aligned}2-3\\text{i} & \\text{i} \\\\ 3 & -1-\\text{i}\\end{aligned}]\\cdot [\\begin{aligned}2\\text{i} & 5 \\\\ 1-4\\text{i} & 2+\\text{i}\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}(2-3\\text{i})\\cdot 2\\text{i}+\\text{i}\\cdot (1-4\\text{i}) & (2-3\\text{i})\\cdot 5+\\text{i}\\cdot (2+\\text{i}) \\\\ 3\\cdot 2\\text{i}+(-1-\\text{i})(1-4\\text{i}) & 3\\cdot 5+(-1-\\text{i})(2+\\text{i})\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}(4\\text{i}+6)+(\\text{i}+4) & (10-15\\text{i})+(2\\text{i}-1) \\\\ 6\\text{i}+(-5+3\\text{i}) & 15+(-1-3\\text{i})\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}10+5\\text{i} & 9-13\\text{i} \\\\ -5+9\\text{i} & 14-3\\text{i}\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-76217/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "83fad21d-6b36-5198-a13f-362d34342475"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-76217"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-76211/selection/369af350ed3d6b76d9b9b72debf5a11111b1dd63362784398eee136b14fd8764" :answer/id #uuid "9fcb75cb-3a54-52b8-890b-d50b9e9feac7" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}6+8\\text{i} \\\\ 18+3\\text{i}\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-76211/selection/8c057d69575ab67956c3ee335a62c3b83048f15b8b12c1a37984f5388692404c" :answer/id #uuid "6b69185f-67b9-5352-b107-8359ad6c9aad" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}18+6\\text{i} \\\\ 3+8\\text{i}\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-76211/selection/bcbf411176040d35438996c310d5d441f647707fb03aca3f81bbd7bf5d2e3047" :answer/id #uuid "450e0076-25d7-5d0b-bbdf-0318ce9df757" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}18+3\\text{i} \\\\ 6+8\\text{i}\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-76211/selection/32dc437a3eabb761a34588543ff488572845d3c38508d6c3535b46db58ab1fe9" :answer/id #uuid "1c674a44-21ed-5afd-9879-eec4da6e55f5" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}18+8\\text{i} \\\\ 6+3\\text{i}\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-76211/selection/b1fe3ffddfc62d3cb2d843a9d3b56ecf28fd768ffeeec56899dd6530f249153d" :answer/id #uuid "49e5184c-f0d5-569a-a4ff-7373f0d666af" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}6+3\\text{i} \\\\ 18+8\\text{i}\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-76211/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "7ef1770f-4e3e-583a-90dd-7b6d699dd957" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-76211/selection/bcbf411176040d35438996c310d5d441f647707fb03aca3f81bbd7bf5d2e3047" :answer-field/choices ["q-76211/selection/369af350ed3d6b76d9b9b72debf5a11111b1dd63362784398eee136b14fd8764" "q-76211/selection/8c057d69575ab67956c3ee335a62c3b83048f15b8b12c1a37984f5388692404c" "q-76211/selection/bcbf411176040d35438996c310d5d441f647707fb03aca3f81bbd7bf5d2e3047" "q-76211/selection/32dc437a3eabb761a34588543ff488572845d3c38508d6c3535b46db58ab1fe9" "q-76211/selection/b1fe3ffddfc62d3cb2d843a9d3b56ecf28fd768ffeeec56899dd6530f249153d"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-76211" :question/id #uuid "4126818a-25d9-570b-ae58-4b53b594488d" :question/math-academy-id "q-76211" :question/problem "If $\\,A=[\\begin{aligned}3+\\text{i} & -\\text{i} & 1-4\\text{i} \\\\ 1-\\text{i} & 1+\\text{i} & 2\\end{aligned}]\\,$ and $\\,x=[\\begin{aligned}1+\\text{i} \\\\ 1-\\text{i} \\\\ 1+4\\text{i}\\end{aligned}]\\,$, then $\\,Ax=$" :question/worked-solution "Multiplying the matrix by the vector using the usual method, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}Ax & =[\\begin{aligned}3+\\text{i} & -\\text{i} & 1-4\\text{i} \\\\ 1-\\text{i} & 1+\\text{i} & 2\\end{aligned}]\\cdot [\\begin{aligned}1+\\text{i} \\\\ 1-\\text{i} \\\\ 1+4\\text{i}\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}(3+\\text{i})(1+\\text{i})+(-\\text{i})(1-\\text{i})+(1-4\\text{i})(1+4\\text{i}) \\\\ (1-\\text{i})(1+\\text{i})+(1+\\text{i})(1-\\text{i})+2(1+4\\text{i})\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}(2+4\\text{i})+(-\\text{i}-1)+17 \\\\ 2+2+(2+8\\text{i})\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}18+3\\text{i} \\\\ 6+8\\text{i}\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-76211/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "83fad21d-6b36-5198-a13f-362d34342475"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-76211"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-76255/selection/d18e2da9510a91181ed20f08915851b1f1f6924f814cf84b8e274f3355899883" :answer/id #uuid "10ce392e-fc4f-540b-9ea4-94fe7dac3471" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}2-\\text{i} & 2\\text{i}+1 \\\\ 0 & \\text{i}\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-76255/selection/4940539e2ad3218bdd4c3389c04e4a26fc9a5edd39abbb76c12a5f9e5c0318d0" :answer/id #uuid "f969df6a-8fd3-5b80-b615-77facf5d0df4" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}2-\\text{i} & 2\\text{i}+1 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-76255/selection/e30489976d20c8129d3e4f10f99e3b4e1e6ace2bc4490d369ab4d9ab3872d1ec" :answer/id #uuid "e8d62e37-6cd2-5de4-953e-fbcf8c01ca14" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}2-\\text{i} & 2\\text{i}+1 \\\\ 1 & \\text{i}\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-76255/selection/942458ae3276f8bf4f2319737ddca7d36f0c9fed1baab98df69c3a5be454dc32" :answer/id #uuid "fa0839e8-fb29-5362-8338-881be7d1e9a7" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}2-\\text{i} & 3\\text{i} \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-76255/selection/1c08366f29d2cdfcd610def68e13421ea3ddcb9e814d9252c7ed84f996c6d5d1" :answer/id #uuid "3dcd3f64-b113-5f52-ba78-3078b3b00d5d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}2-\\text{i} & 2\\text{i}+1 \\\\ 1 & 1\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-76255/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "a6fde116-4ff4-5ade-9411-0ff997ec380e" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-76255/selection/4940539e2ad3218bdd4c3389c04e4a26fc9a5edd39abbb76c12a5f9e5c0318d0" :answer-field/choices ["q-76255/selection/d18e2da9510a91181ed20f08915851b1f1f6924f814cf84b8e274f3355899883" "q-76255/selection/4940539e2ad3218bdd4c3389c04e4a26fc9a5edd39abbb76c12a5f9e5c0318d0" "q-76255/selection/e30489976d20c8129d3e4f10f99e3b4e1e6ace2bc4490d369ab4d9ab3872d1ec" "q-76255/selection/942458ae3276f8bf4f2319737ddca7d36f0c9fed1baab98df69c3a5be454dc32" "q-76255/selection/1c08366f29d2cdfcd610def68e13421ea3ddcb9e814d9252c7ed84f996c6d5d1"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-76255" :question/id #uuid "85edcf48-9f2a-583c-aa8a-8d88bf29e97f" :question/math-academy-id "q-76255" :question/problem "Given the matrix $A=[\\begin{aligned}2-\\text{i} & 2\\text{i}+1 \\\\ 3\\text{i} & -2\\end{aligned}]$, find the result of applying to $A$ the following elementary row operation:\n\n$$\n{R}_{2}:={R}_{2}+(-\\frac{3\\text{i}}{2-\\text{i}}){R}_{1}\n$$" :question/worked-solution "Let's apply the row operations to $A:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A & =[\\begin{aligned}2-\\text{i} & 2\\text{+}1 \\\\ 3\\text{i} & -2\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{2} & :={R}_{2}+(-\\frac{3\\text{i}}{2-\\text{i}}){R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}2-\\text{i} & 2\\text{i}+1 \\\\ 3\\text{i}+(-\\frac{3\\text{i}(2-\\text{i})}{2-\\text{i}}) & -2+(-\\frac{3\\text{i}(2\\text{i}+1)}{2-\\text{i}})\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}2-\\text{i} & 2\\text{i}+1 \\\\ 0 & \\frac{(-4+2\\text{i})+(6-3\\text{i})}{2-\\text{i}}\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}2-\\text{i} & 2\\text{i}+1 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the result  is \n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}2-\\text{i} & 2\\text{i}+1 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{aligned}].\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["q-76255/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "ef2e7753-83f4-5826-a04f-89616d34c578"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-76255"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id [:question/math-academy-id "e-5903"] :question/problem "Find $B=\\overline{A},$ where ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14072897/assets/25ce0cd375da320d1615cf49f659ec33e4646cf6bc66455198bec5fd591b3dd3.png) What is the value of $b_{11} + b_{23}?$" :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:question/math-academy-id "e-5525"] :question/problem "If ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14072897/assets/9e1718bbf8790a9cc89d7cc1c6dd7879f8e222f348e5a9a56fec83a1b033250d.png) and ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14072897/assets/e99949f7e98aee85a040f698b15822927d7aabea1e688337d209c8e1d08850d6.png) are the real and imaginary parts of the matrix ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14072897/assets/642f01152b6a1717300120241f788a24098413648cd70e8d0399629f11be2254.png) then what is the value of $ad+eh?$" :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:question/math-academy-id "e-5902"] :question/problem "If ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14072897/assets/6ca7286f266b56c385ccff4b26d47e2b74b0ba0082d6bfd942b19ae23093eec5.png) and ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14072897/assets/07f35c3f6c37af90636567c6f3851ec775c86be6482775d494178418167a31fb.png), then what is $AB?$" :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:question/math-academy-id "e-5526"] :question/problem "Given the matrix ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14072897/assets/14a711915f94a68eb7db2995698e8f15d8a7554702d9441c826f983bdb81df23.png) find the result of applying to $A$ the following elementary row operations:\n\n$$\nR_1 := \\dfrac{1}{\\textrm{i}}R_1, \\qquad R_2 := R_2 - 2\\textrm{i}R_1\n$$" :question/worked-solution "Let's apply the row operations to $A\\mathbin{:}$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A & =[\\begin{aligned}\\text{i} & -\\text{i} \\\\ 2+2\\text{i} & 1\\end{aligned}]\\, &  & {R}_{1}:=\\frac{1}{\\text{i}}{R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & -1 \\\\ 2+2\\text{i} & 1\\end{aligned}]\\, &  & {R}_{2}:={R}_{2}-2\\text{i}{R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & -1 \\\\ 2 & 1+2\\text{i}\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the result is\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14072897/assets/c25d3059b60a979ccbb37519a8626aec0c6e679bc8a95a6801cf6a0baaf5aee6.png)" :db/ensure [:question/validate]}]
